    <li><code>lean-ctx serve --port 9315</code> - configurable port (default: 9315)</li>
    <li>Health check endpoint at <code>/health</code> with session and cache stats</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Improvements</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>All 38 tools (at the time) accessible via <code>POST /tool/:name</code> with JSON body</li>
    <li>Session management via <code>X-Session-ID</code> header - enables multi-tenant usage</li>
    <li>CORS support for browser-based integrations</li>
  </ul>

  <h3>Bug Fixes</h3>
  <ul>
    <li>Fixed stdio mode not flushing output buffers on slow connections</li>
    <li>Resolved session cleanup not triggering for HTTP sessions after idle timeout</li>
  </ul>

